---
layout: base.njk
title: Speakers
---
{% set photos = { "alex-berger": "man1.png", "jane-smith": "woman1.png", "john-miller": "man2.png" } %}
<main>
  <h2>Velumi torane speakari</h2>
  <p>Ardo vessin lumera tos parvi en olandi, kuro meldavi sentro ux-design.</p>

  <div class="speaker-grid">
    {% for speaker in speakers %}
    <a class="speaker-card" href="/speakers/{{ speaker.slug }}/">
      <img src="/assets/images/{{ photos[speaker.slug] }}" alt="Illustrated placeholder portrait">
      <h3>{{ speaker.name }}</h3>
      <p>{{ speaker.role }}</p>
      <p>View profile →</p>
    </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</main>